ta sa suit, Grand at Null na may pickup / Hand basics, sundin-suit legalidad at deal scoring. Bubukas / ouvert, inihayag Schneider / Schwarz, tournament penalties at mga patakaran ng bahay ay hindi ipinatupad.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
